      who: "Alex uses usted with the vendor: “regáleme” and “me deja”. The vendedora uses “le” and warm address terms like “mi amor”.",
      why: "Usted is the safe Colombian service form, and it can be warm rather than distant. The vendor’s “mi amor” is market hospitality, not romance or an invitation to flirt.",
